{
"#name"
:
{
"time"
:
null
,
"cn"
:
"命令执行时间测量与统计分析"
,
"en"
:
"Command execution timing and statistical analysis"
}
,
"#meta"
:
{
"default-subcmd"
:
"getreal"
}
,
"#synopsis"
:
[
{
"x time <command> [args...]"
:
null
}
,
{
"x time getms <command> [args...]"
:
null
}
,
{
"x time stress [ -c <count> ] [ -b <budget_sec> ] [ --csv|--csv0|--tsv|--tsv0|--yml|--tty ] <command> [args...]"
:
null
}
,
{
"x time cmp [ -c <count> ] [ --csv|--csv0|--tsv|--tsv0|--yml|--tty ] <cmd1> <cmd2> [cmd3...]"
:
null
}
]
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"测量命令执行时间，从单次微秒级计时到多次统计分析。\nstress 子命令提供完整统计（count/min/max/avg/median/stddev），包含三段式自动校准和 batch10 快命令优化。\ncmp 子命令对比多个命令的性能，默认交互终端以 csv app 浏览，管道则以 TSV 输出。\n"
,
"en"
:
"Measure command execution time, from single-shot microsecond timing to multi-run statistical analysis.\nThe stress subcommand provides full statistics (count/min/max/avg/median/stddev) with three-phase calibration and batch10 fast-command optimization.\nThe cmp subcommand compares multiple commands' performance, defaulting to csv app on interactive terminal and TSV on pipe.\n"
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"stress 和 cmp 默认行为:\n- 交互终端下，以 csv app 浏览数据（表格形式）\n- 管道或重定向时，以 TSV 格式输出（适合 awk/grep 处理）\n"
,
"en"
:
"stress and cmp default behavior:\n- Interactive terminal: opens csv app viewer (spreadsheet-like)\n- Pipe or redirect: outputs TSV format (for awk/grep processing)\n"
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"推荐用法:\n1. x time <cmd> — 交互使用，微秒级精度结果\n2. x time log <cmd> — 脚本使用，打印执行时间与返回码\n3. x time stress <cmd> — 性能分析，交互终端以 csv app 浏览\n4. x time cmp <cmd1> <cmd2> — 性能对比\n"
,
"en"
:
"Recommended usage:\n1. x time <cmd> — interactive use, microsecond precision result\n2. x time log <cmd> — scripting, print execution time and return code\n3. x time stress <cmd> — performance analysis, csv app viewer on interactive terminal\n4. x time cmp <cmd1> <cmd2> — performance comparison\n"
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"脚本集成:\n- x time getms_ <cmd> — 将耗时（毫秒）写入变量 x_，适合脚本内部判断\n- x time stress --csv0 <cmd> — 无表头 CSV，适合数据库导入\n- x time stress --tsv0 <cmd> — 无表头 TSV，单行输出，适合捕获到变量\n- x time cmp --tsv0 <cmd1> <cmd2> — 多命令对比数据，适合管道处理\n"
,
"en"
:
"Script integration:\n- x time getms_ <cmd> — write elapsed time (ms) to variable x_, for in-script decisions\n- x time stress --csv0 <cmd> — headerless CSV, for database import\n- x time stress --tsv0 <cmd> — headerless TSV, single-line output, easy to capture in a variable\n- x time cmp --tsv0 <cmd1> <cmd2> — multi-command comparison data, for pipe processing\n"
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"统计指标解读:\n- max — 冷启动/最坏情况，最接近真实首次执行时间\n- avg — 平均时间，因缓存效应通常低于实际首次运行\n- median — 中位数，排除极端值后的典型时间\n- stddev — 波动程度，值大说明执行时间不稳定\n- second/third — 排除最高值后的第二/第三高值，辅助判断极值是否为异常\n"
,
"en"
:
"Statistics interpretation:\n- max — cold start / worst case, closest to real first-run time\n- avg — average, usually lower than actual first run due to caching\n- median — middle value, typical time excluding extremes\n- stddev — variability; high values indicate unstable execution time\n- second/third — 2nd/3rd highest excluding the max, helps assess if max is an outlier\n"
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"缓存效应: 多次运行时 avg 通常低于首次真实执行时间（CPU 缓存、磁盘缓存、页缓存等因素）。\n如需评估用户体验，应重点关注 max 而非 avg。\n"
,
"en"
:
"Cache effects: avg is usually lower than real first-run time due to CPU/disk/page caching.\nFor user-facing performance assessment, focus on max rather than avg.\n"
}
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x time echo hello"
,
"cn"
:
"单次测量 echo hello 的执行时间"
,
"en"
:
"Single-shot timing of echo hello"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x time sleep 1"
,
"cn"
:
"测量 sleep 1 的执行时间"
,
"en"
:
"Measure execution time of sleep 1"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x time getms sleep 1"
,
"cn"
:
"毫秒精度测量，返回毫秒数"
,
"en"
:
"Millisecond precision timing, returns milliseconds"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x time stress sleep 0.01"
,
"cn"
:
"交互终端以 csv app 浏览，管道则以 TSV 输出"
,
"en"
:
"Interactive terminal opens csv app; pipe outputs TSV"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x time stress -c 100 sleep 0.01"
,
"cn"
:
"指定运行 100 次，交互终端以 csv app 浏览"
,
"en"
:
"Specify 100 runs, interactive terminal opens csv app"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x time stress --csv sleep 0.01"
,
"cn"
:
"CSV 格式输出（带表头），适合数据库导入、表格软件或脚本处理"
,
"en"
:
"CSV output with header, suitable for database import, spreadsheets, or scripting"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x time stress --tsv sleep 0.01"
,
"cn"
:
"TSV 格式输出（带表头），适合管道和 awk/grep 处理"
,
"en"
:
"TSV output with header, suitable for piping with awk/grep"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x time stress --tsv0 sleep 0.01"
,
"cn"
:
"无表头 TSV，适合程序解析"
,
"en"
:
"Headerless TSV, for programmatic use"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x time cmp 'echo hello' 'printf hello'"
,
"cn"
:
"对比 echo 和 printf，交互终端以 csv app 浏览，管道则以 TSV 输出"
,
"en"
:
"Compare echo vs printf; interactive terminal opens csv app, pipe outputs TSV"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x time cmp --csv 'echo hello' 'printf hello'"
,
"cn"
:
"CSV 格式对比输出，适合表格软件"
,
"en"
:
"CSV format comparison, suitable for spreadsheets"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x time cmp --tty 'find . -maxdepth 1' 'ls' 'ls -la'"
,
"cn"
:
"人类可读格式对比三个命令"
,
"en"
:
"Human-readable comparison of three commands"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x time cmp -c 50 'cat /dev/null' 'true' ':'"
,
"cn"
:
"对比三个命令各运行 50 次"
,
"en"
:
"Compare three commands, 50 runs each"
}
]
,
"#subcmd:Measure"
:
[
"getms"
]
,
"#subcmd:Statistics"
:
[
"stress"
]
,
"#subcmd:Compare"
:
[
"cmp"
]
,
"#subcmd-definitions"
:
null
,
"getms"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"毫秒级精度单次计时"
,
"en"
:
"Millisecond precision single-shot timing"
}
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x time getms sleep 1"
,
"cn"
:
"毫秒精度测量 sleep 1"
,
"en"
:
"Millisecond precision timing of sleep 1"
}
]
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"要计时的命令"
,
"en"
:
"Command to time"
}
}
}
,
"stress"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"压力测试 — 多次运行命令并输出完整统计。\n自动校准消除 shell 计时开销，batch10 模式优化微秒级命令的测量精度。\n"
,
"en"
:
"Stress test — run a command multiple times with full statistics.\nAuto-calibration eliminates shell timing overhead; batch10 mode optimizes measurement precision for microsecond-level commands.\n"
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"不带格式选项时，交互终端以 csv app 浏览，管道或重定向则以 TSV 输出。"
,
"en"
:
"Without a format flag, interactive terminals open csv app; pipe or redirect outputs TSV."
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"不指定 -c 和 -b 时，默认 5 秒预算自动估算运行次数。"
,
"en"
:
"Without -c or -b, auto-estimates run count within a 5-second budget."
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"快命令（< 1ms）自动使用 batch10 模式（10 次一批），减少计时误差。"
,
"en"
:
"Fast commands (< 1ms) automatically use batch10 mode (10 per batch) to reduce timing error."
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"offset 值为校准开销，已在统计中扣除。校准过程在每次 stress 开始时自动执行。"
,
"en"
:
"The offset value is calibration overhead, already subtracted from statistics. Calibration runs automatically at the start of each stress session."
}
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x time stress sleep 0.01"
,
"cn"
:
"交互终端以 csv app 浏览，管道则以 TSV 输出"
,
"en"
:
"Interactive terminal opens csv app; pipe outputs TSV"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x time stress -c 100 sleep 0.01"
,
"cn"
:
"指定运行 100 次"
,
"en"
:
"Specify 100 runs"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x time stress -b 10 sleep 0.01"
,
"cn"
:
"10 秒预算内自动决定运行次数"
,
"en"
:
"Auto-decide run count within 10-second budget"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x time stress --csv sleep 0.01"
,
"cn"
:
"CSV 格式（带表头），适合数据库导入、表格软件或脚本处理"
,
"en"
:
"CSV format with header, suitable for database import, spreadsheets, or scripting"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x time stress --tsv sleep 0.01"
,
"cn"
:
"TSV 格式（带表头），适合管道和 awk/grep 处理"
,
"en"
:
"TSV format with header, suitable for piping with awk/grep"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x time stress --tsv0 sleep 0.01"
,
"cn"
:
"无表头 TSV，适合程序解析"
,
"en"
:
"Headerless TSV, for programmatic use"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x time stress --tty sleep 0.01"
,
"cn"
:
"人类可读格式输出（纯文本统计）"
,
"en"
:
"Human-readable format (plain text statistics)"
}
]
,
"-c"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"运行次数（不指定则按 -b 预算自动估算）"
,
"en"
:
"Number of runs (auto-estimated from -b budget if not specified)"
}
}
,
"-b"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"时间预算（秒），默认 5 秒"
,
"en"
:
"Time budget in seconds (default 5)"
}
}
,
"--csv"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"CSV 格式输出（带表头）"
,
"en"
:
"CSV output with header"
}
}
,
"--csv0"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"CSV 格式输出（无表头）"
,
"en"
:
"CSV output without header"
}
}
,
"--tsv"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"TSV 格式输出（带表头）"
,
"en"
:
"TSV output with header"
}
}
,
"--tsv0"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"TSV 格式输出（无表头）"
,
"en"
:
"TSV output without header"
}
}
,
"--tty"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"人类可读格式输出"
,
"en"
:
"Human-readable format output"
}
}
,
"--yml"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"YAML 格式输出"
,
"en"
:
"YAML format output"
}
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"要计时的命令"
,
"en"
:
"Command to time"
}
}
}
,
"cmp"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"对比多个命令的执行时间。\n内部调用 stress --tsv0 获取每个命令的统计数据，合并输出。\n默认: 交互终端以 csv app 浏览，管道则以 TSV 输出。\n"
,
"en"
:
"Compare execution time of multiple commands.\nInternally calls stress --tsv0 for each command's statistics and merges the results.\nDefault: interactive terminal opens csv app; pipe outputs TSV.\n"
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"不带格式选项时，交互终端以 csv app 浏览，管道或重定向则以 TSV 输出。"
,
"en"
:
"Without a format flag, interactive terminals open csv app; pipe or redirect outputs TSV."
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"命令以 eval 方式执行，支持管道和重定向: x time cmp 'cat file | wc -l' 'wc -l < file'"
,
"en"
:
"Commands are executed via eval, supporting pipes and redirects: x time cmp 'cat file | wc -l' 'wc -l < file'"
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"支持两个或更多命令的对比，不限数量。"
,
"en"
:
"Supports comparing two or more commands, no limit."
}
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x time cmp 'echo hello' 'printf hello'"
,
"cn"
:
"对比 echo 和 printf，交互终端以 csv app 浏览，管道则以 TSV 输出"
,
"en"
:
"Compare echo vs printf; interactive terminal opens csv app, pipe outputs TSV"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x time cmp --csv 'echo hello' 'printf hello'"
,
"cn"
:
"CSV 格式对比输出，适合数据库导入、表格软件或脚本处理"
,
"en"
:
"CSV format comparison, for database import, spreadsheets, or scripting"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x time cmp --tsv 'echo hello' 'printf hello'"
,
"cn"
:
"TSV 格式对比输出，适合管道和 awk/grep 处理"
,
"en"
:
"TSV format comparison, for piping with awk/grep"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x time cmp --tty 'echo hello' 'printf hello'"
,
"cn"
:
"人类可读格式，显示 avg ± stddev / median / total"
,
"en"
:
"Human-readable format, showing avg ± stddev / median / total"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x time cmp --tsv0 'sleep 0.01' 'sleep 0.02'"
,
"cn"
:
"无表头 TSV，适合程序解析和管道处理"
,
"en"
:
"Headerless TSV, for programmatic use and pipe processing"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x time cmp -c 50 'echo hello' 'printf hello' 'true'"
,
"cn"
:
"对比三个命令各运行 50 次"
,
"en"
:
"Compare three commands, 50 runs each"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x time cmp 'find . -maxdepth 1' 'ls' 'ls -la'"
,
"cn"
:
"对比三种文件列表方式的性能"
,
"en"
:
"Compare three file listing methods' performance"
}
]
,
"-c"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"每个命令运行次数（不指定则按 stress 默认自动估算）"
,
"en"
:
"Run count per command (auto-estimated by stress if not specified)"
}
}
,
"--csv"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"CSV 格式输出（带表头）"
,
"en"
:
"CSV output with header"
}
}
,
"--csv0"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"CSV 格式输出（无表头）"
,
"en"
:
"CSV output without header"
}
}
,
"--tsv"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"TSV 格式输出（带表头）"
,
"en"
:
"TSV output with header"
}
}
,
"--tsv0"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"TSV 格式输出（无表头）"
,
"en"
:
"TSV output without header"
}
}
,
"--tty"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"人类可读格式输出（avg ± stddev / median / total / runs）"
,
"en"
:
"Human-readable format (avg ± stddev / median / total / runs)"
}
}
,
"--yml"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"YAML 格式输出"
,
"en"
:
"YAML format output"
}
}
,
"#1.."
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"要对比的命令（2 个或更多）"
,
"en"
:
"Commands to compare (2 or more)"
}
}
}
}

